{"id":"live-20261117-121433","title":"Marmalade Morning","dur":218.64,"events":[{"type":"state","text":"Getting the workshop ready","t":0},{"type":"mode","mode":"chat","t":0.31},{"type":"look","to":"front","t":0.32},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.plan","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.plan.ogg","d":5.34,"text":"Build a tiny ginger kitten with bright eyes, soft cream cheeks, and a curled tail on a mint cushion.","t":0.32},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn tells where the idea came from","t":6.97},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.insp","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.insp.ogg","d":10.43,"text":"This little cat draws from cozy handheld-game sprites and the rounded shapes of embroidered nursery pictures. The colours suggest a quiet morning beside a sunny window.","t":8.48},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":22.65},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 1 of 72","t":23},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":23.42},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.1","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.1.ogg","d":10.14,"text":"I begin with the SOLID tool for a lavender room and a mint cushion; these gentle colours will let our warm little kitten stand out. A few cream marks with LINE and PEN add a little morning sparkle.","t":23.42},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":23.42},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":35.53},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":35.53},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":37.13},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":37.13},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 2 of 72","t":37.13},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 3 of 72","t":37.54},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 4 of 72","t":37.97},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 5 of 72","t":38.38},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 6 of 72","t":38.79},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 7 of 72","t":39.2},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 8 of 72","t":39.62},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 9 of 72","t":40.04},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":40.47},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.9","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.9.ogg","d":9.08,"text":"I use SOLID blocks to give the cushion a pale mint top and start a curled tail in dark brown and ginger. The brown edge keeps the small silhouette clear against the lavender.","t":40.47},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":40.47},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":51.34},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":51.34},{"type":"pose","n":11,"ms":1100,"t":52.96},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":54.07},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":54.07},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":55.68},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":55.68},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 10 of 72","t":55.68},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 11 of 72","t":56.09},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 12 of 72","t":56.51},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 13 of 72","t":56.93},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 14 of 72","t":57.35},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 15 of 72","t":57.78},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 16 of 72","t":58.19},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 17 of 72","t":58.62},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":59.04},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.17","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.17.ogg","d":9.18,"text":"With SOLID, I build a compact ginger body, a cream bib, and two broad little paws. Keeping the feet low and close together gives the kitten a settled, comfortable pose.","t":59.04},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":59.04},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":70.25},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":70.25},{"type":"pose","n":11,"ms":1100,"t":71.86},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":72.98},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":72.98},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":74.63},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":74.63},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 18 of 72","t":74.63},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 19 of 72","t":75.07},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 20 of 72","t":75.47},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 21 of 72","t":75.89},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 22 of 72","t":76.32},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 23 of 72","t":76.74},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 24 of 72","t":77.17},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 25 of 72","t":77.57},{"type":"react","cat":"hmm","t":78.01},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":79.47},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.25","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.25.ogg","d":11.88,"text":"I finish the paws with PEN marks, then use SOLID for an oversized brown-edged head and the first pointed ear. The large head and tiny toes are deliberate choices to make our cat feel young.","t":79.48},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":79.48},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":93.76},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":93.76},{"type":"pose","n":11,"ms":1100,"t":95.39},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":96.49},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":96.49},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":98.11},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":98.11},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 26 of 72","t":98.11},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 27 of 72","t":98.51},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 28 of 72","t":98.94},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 29 of 72","t":99.35},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 30 of 72","t":99.77},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 31 of 72","t":100.2},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 32 of 72","t":100.6},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 33 of 72","t":101.03},{"type":"react","cat":"hmm","t":101.44},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":102.63},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.33","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.33.ogg","d":9.51,"text":"I fill the face with ginger using SOLID, leaving its dark brown border visible. Pale gold ear edges and a dusty pink inner ear bring a little softness to those angular shapes.","t":102.63},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":102.63},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":113.98},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":113.98},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":115.6},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":115.6},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":115.6},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 34 of 72","t":115.61},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 35 of 72","t":116.02},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 36 of 72","t":116.44},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 37 of 72","t":116.87},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 38 of 72","t":117.27},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 39 of 72","t":117.69},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 40 of 72","t":118.11},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 41 of 72","t":118.52},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":118.95},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.41","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.41.ogg","d":8.84,"text":"The SOLID tool adds orange tabby stripes and two cream cheeks. I keep the stripes broad and the muzzle light so the expression will remain easy to read at this tiny size.","t":118.95},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":118.95},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":129.71},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":129.71},{"type":"pose","n":11,"ms":1100,"t":131.35},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":132.48},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":132.48},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":134.09},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":134.09},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":134.09},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 42 of 72","t":134.09},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 43 of 72","t":134.49},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 44 of 72","t":134.92},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 45 of 72","t":135.41},{"type":"look","to":"room","t":135.84},{"type":"pose","n":4,"ms":2600,"t":135.85},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn takes a closer look","t":135.85},{"type":"look","to":"front","t":138.49},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 46 of 72","t":139.53},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 47 of 72","t":140.01},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 48 of 72","t":140.5},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 49 of 72","t":140.95},{"type":"react","cat":"hmm","t":141.38},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":143.54},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.49","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.49.ogg","d":10.31,"text":"I use short LINE strokes for dark eyes and a pink nose, then place cream glints with PEN. Those single bright pixels give the kitten an alert look without making the face busy.","t":143.54},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":143.54},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":162.35},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":162.35},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":164.04},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":164.04},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 50 of 72","t":164.04},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 51 of 72","t":164.45},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 52 of 72","t":164.99},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 53 of 72","t":165.5},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 54 of 72","t":165.97},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 55 of 72","t":166.42},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 56 of 72","t":166.93},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 57 of 72","t":167.32},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":167.9},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.57","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.57.ogg","d":9.44,"text":"I finish the small mouth with PEN and draw brown whiskers with LINE. Dusty pink cheeks warm the face, while the whiskers reach beyond the head to make the cat silhouette unmistakable.","t":167.9},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":167.91},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":169},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":169},{"type":"pose","n":11,"ms":1100,"t":170.66},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":171.85},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":171.85},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":173.48},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":173.48},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":173.48},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 58 of 72","t":173.48},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 59 of 72","t":173.9},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 60 of 72","t":174.33},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 61 of 72","t":174.74},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 62 of 72","t":175.15},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 63 of 72","t":175.57},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 64 of 72","t":175.98},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 65 of 72","t":176.41},{"type":"mode","mode":"measure","t":176.86},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.s1.65","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.s1.65.ogg","d":11.55,"text":"For the last touches, I use SOLID and LINE to brighten the cream bib and paws, then add orange stripes to the body and tail. These small repetitions tie the kitten together without crowding the face.","t":176.86},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn explains what comes next","t":176.86},{"type":"pose","n":8,"ms":1600,"t":191.1},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn measures","t":191.1},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":192.78},{"type":"mode","mode":"paint","t":192.78},{"type":"bg","cat":"hum","vol":0.45,"t":192.78},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 66 of 72","t":192.78},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 67 of 72","t":193.22},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 68 of 72","t":193.72},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 69 of 72","t":194.23},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 70 of 72","t":194.74},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 71 of 72","t":195.25},{"type":"state","text":"Drawing: order 72 of 72","t":195.77},{"type":"mode","mode":"chat","t":196.23},{"type":"look","to":"room","t":196.23},{"type":"pose","n":4,"ms":3500,"t":196.23},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn turns the screen to herself to look at her work","t":196.23},{"type":"pose","n":4,"ms":60000,"t":199.88},{"type":"say","key":"live-20261117-121433.end","f":"live/audio/live-20261117-121433.end.ogg","d":12.32,"text":"The finished kitten reads clearly through its pointed ears, bright eyes, and curled tail. The warm ginger fur sits gently against the lavender background, while the mint cushion gives the compact pose a soft base.","t":199.88},{"type":"state","text":"Quinn looks at it and thinks it over","t":199.88},{"type":"pose","n":0,"ms":1,"t":216.04},{"type":"mode","mode":"chat","t":216.04},{"type":"look","to":"front","t":216.04},{"type":"state","text":"Finished.","t":216.04},{"type":"rate","stars":"★★★★☆","html":"<div><b>Matches my plan: </b>yes</div><div><b>Best part: </b>bright eyes and cream cheeks</div><div><b>Next time: </b>give the curled tail a little more breathing room</div>","t":217.61}]}